# Etaernal configuration index — this root file is NOT loaded by all subsystems.
# Backend: copy backend/.env.example to backend/.env; run from backend/.
# Website: copy apps/web/web_app/.env.example to .env.local in that directory.
# Flutter: use --dart-define; see apps/mobile/flutter_app/.env.example.
# Never copy private provider credentials into client environments.
# Full instructions: docs/development/setup.md
